# What never needs to reach a serverless function.
#
# The bundle limit is 500 MB for Python, which sounds generous until you notice `data/`
# alone is 3,826 files: the crawled corpus, the eval photographs, and every image anyone
# has ever uploaded to a local run. None of it is read at runtime, because the corpus
# lives in Pinecone and the uploads live in the database. Shipping it would cost cold
# start time on every instance for files nothing opens.

data/
logs/
scripts/
tests/
docs/
db/

.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.secrets/

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
pytest.ini
run.py
